# party.pdl - which RPG Maker MV monster picture (character sheet Monster.png: 8 monsters, 3 walk frames x 4 directions each; index = col + 4*row) each gta-hq pet wears.
# The pets are their OWN RPG Maker DB entries, NOT the old pet-trainer pets: &.widgits/db-hq/data/system.pdl (SYSTEM RpgPetParty member1..6) and actors.pdl (ACTOR ids 19-24: name,
# nickname, profile, mhp, mmp, atk, def, mat, mdf, agi, luk). Each has its own entity_uid (state/uid_<id>.txt) and therefore its own wallet identity (e + first 24 hex), see CHAIN-ECONOMY-DESIGN.md.
# A DB ACTOR "character" value of Sheet:index would win over this file (the DB field holds just the sheet name today). This file is only the picture choice, never the data.
# The PERSON (Actor1 sheet) is the trainer / player and lives in the village (not built in gta-hq yet).
# PET | actor name | sheet | index
